E020_void_used_as_value.cmm:4:13: semantic error: function 'foo' returns no value and cannot be used in an expression
  |
4 |     let x = foo();
  |             ^^^
what went wrong:
  'foo' does not give back a value, so it cannot be used inside an
  expression.
how to fix:
  Call it on its own line: 'foo(...);'.
      foo();
